==Strategy==
This stage may seem scary, but with the right strategy it's just a more RNG-dependent version of Z-Onel's [[Last of the Dead (Merciless)|original stage]].

The best way to go about it is to lure in Fallen Bear, nuke it down with either [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar]] or a combination of [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Cat Researcher]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]], then smuggle a stack of [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCats]] into Z-Onel's blindspot in the same manner as Last of the Dead. The major sticking point is the possibility of Devil Wife's [[Death Surge]] ruining your BearCat stack and your day.

If you successfully [[Zombie Killer|Z-Kill]] Z-Onel, you win. Otherwise, lure and nuke the second Fallen Bear in the same manner as the first one. Outside Fallen Bear and Devil Wife, the support isn't anything to worry about, [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling]] can handle the Aku and Cadaver BearCat can handle the Zombies.

